28
00:01:02,240 --> 00:01:04,810
Then it reads again, and confirms exactly one

29
00:01:04,810 --> 00:01:05,623
payment.

30
00:01:06,423 --> 00:01:08,487
Only after the run does the Space reveal the

31
00:01:08,487 --> 00:01:10,772
hidden database. The script:

32
00:01:10,772 --> 00:01:13,201
false success, and no payment at all.

33
00:01:13,201 --> 00:01:15,996
The trained agent: exactly one payment, goal

34
00:01:15,996 --> 00:01:18,555
